# Line endings are not cosmetic here.
#
# tools/gen_wire_doc.js parses the golden vectors out of test/*.cpp to write docs/WIRE.md.
# Its first regex ended on `;\n`, which does not match `;\r\n` — so test_updatelist_wire,
# the one file that happened to be CRLF, contributed NOTHING and an entire panel family was
# missing from the published wire document. Nobody saw it, because the generator's --check
# compares its own output against itself.
#
# The parser is fixed and now refuses to write a document it knows is short. This file makes
# the input uniform anyway, so the next parser does not have to be as careful.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.bin binary
